sequenceDiagram
    participant Provider
    participant Visitor
    participant System

    Provider->>System: verified, gets a public profile link
    Visitor->>System: browse directory or open shared profile link
    System-->>Visitor: public listing or profile (no account)

    Visitor->>System: try to book, pay, or message
    System-->>Visitor: sign up or sign in required
    Visitor->>System: sign up or sign in
    System-->>Visitor: continue to booking
